<Layout title="Contact - Bin Stores USA" description="Contact Bin Stores USA: a links directory of US bin stores. How to report a wrong listing, and what this site does and does not do.">
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p>Bin Stores USA is a links directory of bin stores in the United States. Each listing has a store name, a city and state, an address when a public source lists one, and a link to a public listing for that store. The site gives no shopping advice and it does not rate, check, or vouch for any store.</p>
  <h2>Report a wrong listing</h2>
  <p>Listings are checked from public sources, and stores close or move, so a listing can go out of date. If a listing is wrong, the store's own page is the best place to check first, because hours and prices change often.</p>
  <p>There is no email address and no form on this site yet, so there is no direct way to send a correction right now. Listings are updated when the public sources they come from change. This page will be updated if a way to report a correction is added.</p>
  <h2>What this site does not do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>It does not take bookings or sell anything.</li>
    <li>It does not give shopping advice.</li>
    <li>It does not rate, rank, check, or vouch for any store.</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
